# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. A single-tree saga's decision Mark is
# admitted while its tree is gated, so the decision - and the terminals it
# licenses - lands after the snapshot: a shard captured after a terminal
# holds the saga post-saga while another resolves it against the snapshot,
# pre-saga.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentMarkUnderGate
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a decision Mark is recorded while the gate is held
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
    /\ ~CrossTree(t) => ~Gated("T1")
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the gate does not refuse the Mark.
--- END
